# Project entry (ai-autonomous-backend)

**Globals are mandatory for all work** — follow `~/.cursor/rules/global-work-strict.mdc` and `global-agent-routing.mdc`. This table **adds** project routes; it does **not** waive globals.

Global: `~/.cursor/rules/global-agent-routing.mdc` / `project-foundation.mdc` / `global-work-strict.mdc`

**If:** a row below matches, **Then:** follow that reference. Read the `.mdc` / skill only when full text is not already in context (globs may already include it).

| Situation | Follow |
|-----------|--------|
| Before non-trivial work (pipeline) | Global `project-foundation` — grill → `grill-writeback` → plan if multi-file → … |
| Languages · DB · frameworks | `docs/agents/stack.md` (else `~/.cursor/rules/default-stack.mdc`) |
| Code edits | `.cursor/rules/implementation-core.mdc` |
| Tests | `.cursor/rules/testing-istqb.mdc` (+ `tdd-discipline` when writing tests) |
| Secrets · Git | `.cursor/rules/security-git.mdc` |
| Before commit / push / PR | `~/.cursor/rules/git-commit-boundary.mdc` |
| After edits / before 完了 | `agent-self-review` → `verification-before-done` |
| URL/UI DoD smoke | `browser-smoke-verify` + `browser-chrome.mdc` |
| Web UI copy | `~/.cursor/rules/ui-i18n-locale.mdc` + project frontend rules if any |
| Web UI look · dashboards | `distinctive-ui` skill + `~/.cursor/rules/distinctive-ui.mdc` |
| React/TSX naming · prop shadowing | `~/.cursor/rules/react-component-conventions.mdc` |
| Shell (WSL) | `wsl-agent-invoke` skill |
| Doc locales | `docs-language` skill |
| Skill / rule inventory | `docs/agents/skill-set.md` |
| Pre-commit / implementation-review (explicit) | `.cursor/rules/implementation-review.mdc` (7-stage; user-requested only) |
| Post-implementation retrospective | `.cursor/rules/implementation-retrospective.mdc` (read → steps → append `docs/implementation-retrospective.md`) |

